OL,3,AMajor Thanksgiving storms in US disrupt
OL,4,Aflights and leave 600,000 customers
OL,5,Awithout power
OL,6,
OL,7,FOne storm is currently making it up the
OL,8,FUS eastern seaboard with reports of
OL,9,Fwind gusts as high as 70 to 80 mph in
OL,10,Fthe Virginia area
OL,12,FIn Maryland, two people in Montgomery
OL,13,FCounty and one woman in Mechanicsville
OL,14,Fhave been rescued after large trees
OL,15,Fcrushed their homes
OL,17,FIn New York City, the Macy's
OL,18,FThanksgiving Day Parade has been put
OL,19,Fback until Saturday - Mayor Zohran
OL,20,FMamdani says it "will be a heavy storm"
OL,21,Fwith the danger of winds bringing down
OL,22,F"tree limbs and power lines"
OL,23,APub: 26-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
